  // Nix: it turns on the LSP (nixd) of the jnoortheen.nix-ide extension. The extension's
  // default is false, so WITHOUT this line there is no language server at all, only syntax
  // highlighting. It stays here, and not in the repo's .vscode/, because it is independent of
  // machine and carries no path: it holds for any .nix I open, and Settings Sync propagates it.
  // The config WITH a path (nixd.options/nixpkgs) lives in the dotfiles repo's
  // .vscode/settings.json, versioned next to the flake.
  "nix.enableLanguageServer": true,
  // nixfmt through the LSP. The global formatOnSave (above) is already true and the global
  // formatter is prettier, which does not know Nix, so without this block saving a .nix did not
